{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"bcd32751-452d-4650-8c7c-01284c6130eb","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have investigated and resolved the issues with the Intervals.icu integration. The findings and breakdown of applicable notes have been documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-UQSDPL/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Causes \u0026 Fixes\n\n1. **Connect Button 401 Unauthorized**:\n   - **Cause**: The \"Connect Intervals.icu\" button was rendered as `\u003ca href=\"/api/intervals/auth/init\"\u003e`. Full-page document navigations in browsers do not send the `Authorization` header kept in `localStorage`.\n   - **Fix**: Updated `/api/intervals/auth/init` in [server.py](file:///tmp/h-UQSDPL/server.py#L148-L165) to accept authenticated `POST` requests and return `{\"authorize_url\": ...}`. Updated [static/app.js](file:///tmp/h-UQSDPL/static/app.js#L28-L43) to call this endpoint via `api()` and navigate with `window.location.assign(res.authorize_url)`.\n\n2. **400 Invalid Request on Authorization / Consent**:\n   - **Cause**: Intervals.icu disallows duplicate areas in scopes (`:WRITE` implies `:READ`). Requesting both `ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE` and `CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE` triggered errors.\n   - **Fix**: In [config.py](file:///tmp/h-UQSDPL/config.py#L11), deduplicated scopes to `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`.\n\n3. **Status Changing to \"Expired, reconnect\" After 1 Hour**:\n   - **Cause**: Intervals.icu tokens do not expire or issue refresh tokens. [server.py](file:///tmp/h-UQSDPL/server.py) fell back to a default 3600s TTL and ran a background loop checking for expiry. After 1 hour, lacking a `refresh_token`, it marked the status as `\"expired, reconnect\"`.\n   - **Fix**: Removed the artificial TTL and the background refresher thread. Implemented lazy token revocation on HTTP 401 responses from Intervals.icu in [`wellness()`](file:///tmp/h-UQSDPL/server.py#L200-L215).\n\n4. **Token Exchange Parameters**:\n   - **Fix**: Adjusted [`exchange_code()`](file:///tmp/h-UQSDPL/server.py#L57-L63) in [server.py](file:///tmp/h-UQSDPL/server.py) to send only `client_id`, `client_secret`, and `code`.\n","duration_seconds":132.209012,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":136346,"output_tokens":6933,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":703261,"total_tokens":143279}}}
